  description: '2 Zombie monsters

    If you would Tribute a monster(s) for a Tribute
    Summon, you can Tribute a Zombie monster(s) your opponent controls, even though
    you do not control them. You can only use each of the following effects of "Vampire
    Sucker" once per turn. You can target 1 monster in your opponent''s GY; Special
    Summon it to your opponent''s field in Defense Position, but it becomes a Zombie
    monster. If a Zombie monster(s) is Special Summoned from either GY: Draw 1 card.'
